# ChatDB Third-Party Credits

ChatDB is built on top of the following excellent open-source projects.
We sincerely thank all the contributors.

## Core Dependencies

| Project | License | Usage |
|---------|---------|-------|
| [nlohmann/json](https://github.com/nlohmann/json) | MIT | JSON serialization/deserialization |
| [fmt](https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt) | MIT | String formatting |
| [spdlog](https://github.com/gabime/spdlog) | MIT | Logging framework |
| [cpp-httplib](https://github.com/yhirose/cpp-httplib) | MIT | HTTP server (REST API + SSE) |
| [ixwebsocket](https://github.com/machinezone/ixwebsocket) | BSD-3-Clause | WebSocket client (OneBot v11) |
| [SQLite](https://www.sqlite.org/) | Public Domain | Local message & memory storage |
| [hiredis](https://github.com/redis/hiredis) | BSD-3-Clause | Redis client (vector index) |
| [OpenSSL](https://www.openssl.org/) | Apache-2.0 | SHA1 hashing & TLS |

